  "releaseNotes": "## What's Changed\n* Fix outlined ComboBox border styles by @Hyz-sui in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/454\n* Expose RippleEffect.RaiseRipple and RaiseRippleAbsoluteCoord function by @appleneko2001 in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/453\n* Add some missing control themes (SplitButton, DropDownButton, ManagedFileChooser), correct FlyoutPresenter by @appleneko2001 in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/455\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Hyz-sui made their first contribution in https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/pull/454\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/AvaloniaCommunity/Material.Avalonia/compare/v3.11.0...v3.12.0",
